# Server-side secrets. Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit the filled file.
#
# DIFY_API_KEY is read only inside a createServerFn handler (src/lib/ask-dify.functions.ts).
# It must NEVER become a VITE_* variable: anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the
# client bundle and shipped to every visitor.
#
# Deployment:
#   Lovable     -> project secret, same name
#   Cloudflare  -> npx wrangler@4 secret put DIFY_API_KEY   (pipe it in, do not paste)
DIFY_API_KEY=
